## Non-Goals

- Do not require byte-for-byte equivalence with Sibernetic particle buffers.
- Do not require a 30,000-step exact particle simulation to finish in 150 ms.
- Do not hide approximations behind the word "exact".
- Do not replace the exact simulator plans. Realtime mode depends on exact/reference outputs for validation.
- Do not use a learned model without mechanistic and behavioral validation.
- Do not require rendering to be scientific ground truth. Simulation state and behavioral metrics are the ground truth.

